    <string name="about_author">Author: Lilian Putină, ER1PL</string>
    <string name="about_propagation">Propagation data (SFI, K, A and the HF band conditions by day and by night) are calculated and published by Paul Herrman, N0NBH, at hamqsl.com. The app downloads them at most once an hour, as the author asks, and shows the time of the last N0NBH update in UTC.</string>

